WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.569 --> 00:00:08.290
If one wishes to discover their highest value
and status in life, it is helpful to consider

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:12.669
the basic economic model of supply and demand.

00:00:12.669 --> 00:00:21.210
A good or service is valued higher when there
is a limited supply of said good or service,

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.740
coupled with a high desire for it.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:31.599
Likewise, a person who is unique and in low
supply, but high in demand and interest to

00:00:31.599 --> 00:00:38.650
humankind will acquire significant higher
value and status in life.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:45.440
In order to discover your value in this life,
you must not be afraid of finding and embracing

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:51.750
your unique self and sharing it with the world.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.969
Not everyone is a person of low supply and
high demand.

00:00:55.969 --> 00:01:02.949
If everyone was, than there would no longer
be a low supply, and consequently, no longer

00:01:02.949 --> 00:01:06.680
would anyone be uniquely valuable.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:14.130
Just like how government bodies and economies
self-regulate supply and demand, so does nature

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:18.470
with greatness and human value.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:24.700
Everyone possesses some form and degree of
greatness, but only some of us possess truly

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.299
unique and sovereign greatness.

00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:34.820
Greatness that slices through all the noise
of the world and yields collective impact,

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:40.900
high virtue, wealth, fame, and power.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:47.909
In order to better understand the distribution
and separation of human greatness, it is helpful

00:01:47.909 --> 00:01:55.479
to consider a species outside of humanity;
the bumblebee.

00:01:55.479 --> 00:01:57.510
Consider the queen bee.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.810
A queen bee is born a queen bee.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:07.630
It is born into higher value and status as
a result of its ability to fulfill a role

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:13.390
that is in low supply and high demand within
its beehive.

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:16.640
Whether the bee wants it or not, it is queen.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:24.000
Likewise, whether you want to or or not, you
may possess unique greatness.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.790
The difference between bees and us is that
bees are immensely less complex.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:38.940
Human culture is far more complicated and
on a much larger scale than that of a beehive.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:46.070
Our higher level of consciousness and cultural
complexity imposes a significant difference

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:53.730
on the process of determining who is what
kind of bee in the human world.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:03:00.890
Unlike a beehive, there is room in the human
world for far more queen bees than the one-per-hive

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:04.140
dynamic of the bee world.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:11.070
Through mass media and mass communication,
our human hives have become enormously large.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:18.970
Our boundaries extend beyond our immediately
surrounding communities and as a result, human

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.570
greatness is far more widespread, complex,
and malleable.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:21.670
If this is true, how does one know how uniquely
and ultimately great they are?

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:25.090
How does one know what kind of bee they are
and where they fit in the human hive that

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:26.090
is the world?

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.090
There are seemingly arbitrary conditions that
foster unique greatness within humans.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.090
And the process of rising to one’s highest
self and developing ultimate greatness is

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:29.090
one of extreme confusion, resistance, and
often inequality.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.090
Amidst the density of culture and social constructs,
it often becomes easy for humans of unique

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.090
greatness to be reduced down to lower worths
and statuses.

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:32.090
And this gives opportunity for humans who
lack real unique greatness, but merely have

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:33.090
more fortunate life circumstances, to be built
up into higher worth’s and statuses.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.090
It is therefore, the obligation of every individual,
both for the benefit of themselves and the

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:39.300
collective quality of humankind, to oppose
the resistance of life and fight tooth and

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:47.120
nail for their greatness in hopes that it
may be low in supply and high in demand.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:53.280
One must go to the end of the world for their
beliefs, ideas, and ambitions.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:58.630
One must trust that they are worth as mush
as they think they are and work untiringly

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.370
throughout life to prove it.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:08.510
With attention, conviction, and action, your
greatness will manifest into its particular

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:15.800
value and you will find out how great it truly
is.

